<link rel="stylesheet" href="/distribution/upload.css?v=9">
<form id="upload-form" data-inspect-url="<%= distribution_inspect_path %>" data-duplicate-url="<%= distribution_duplicate_path %>" data-upload-url="<%= distribution_upload_path %>">
<label class="dropzone package-drop home-drop" id="dropzone"><input type="file" name="file" id="package-file" accept=".ipa,.apk" required aria-label="选择 IPA 或 APK 安装包"><span class="upload-file-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M25 59H20a15 15 0 0 1-2-30 22 22 0 0 1 43-4 17 17 0 0 1 1 34H54M40 70V37m-13 13 13-13 13 13"/></svg></span><strong id="file-label">拖拽到这里上传</strong><span id="file-hint">或点击选择 IPA / APK 文件</span><span class="button file-picker" aria-hidden="true">选择安装包</span></label>
<dialog id="upload-dialog" class="upload-dialog" aria-labelledby="upload-title"><div class="modal-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">NEW RELEASE</span><h2 id="upload-title">上传安装包</h2></div><button type="button" id="upload-close" class="text-button" aria-label="关闭上传窗口">✕</button></div>
<div class="modal-body"><div id="package-preview" class="package-preview" aria-live="polite" aria-busy="true"></div><div id="duplicate-options" class="duplicate-options" hidden><p>所选环境已有相同版本号和 build 号的安装包，发布时需确认是否覆盖旧包。</p></div>
<fieldset class="business-environment-choice"><legend>包环境</legend><label><input type="radio" name="business_environment" value="testing" checked> 测试环境</label><label><input type="radio" name="business_environment" value="production"> 正式环境</label><p>由上传者选择，请确认安装包实际连接的业务环境。</p></fieldset>
<label for="upload-changelog" class="changelog-label">更新日志 <span class="muted">选填</span></label><textarea name="changelog" id="upload-changelog" rows="5" placeholder="本次更新了什么？可留空直接上传"></textarea>
</div><div class="upload-actions"><div class="upload-status"><p id="upload-message" role="status" aria-live="polite">正在识别安装包…</p><progress id="upload-progress" value="0" max="100" hidden aria-label="安装包上传进度"></progress></div><div class="row"><button type="button" class="button secondary" id="upload-retry" hidden>重试上传</button><button class="button" id="upload-submit" disabled>开始上传 ↑</button></div></div></dialog>
<dialog id="upload-success-dialog" class="upload-dialog upload-success-dialog" aria-labelledby="upload-success-title">
<div class="modal-heading"><h2 id="upload-success-title">安装包已就绪</h2><button type="button" id="upload-success-close" class="text-button" aria-label="关闭上传结果" autofocus>✕</button></div>
<div id="upload-result" hidden></div>
</dialog>
<dialog id="overwrite-dialog" class="overwrite-dialog" aria-labelledby="overwrite-title" aria-describedby="overwrite-description">
<button type="button" class="overwrite-close" data-overwrite-cancel aria-label="关闭覆盖确认">×</button>
<p class="overwrite-eyebrow">版本已存在</p><h2 id="overwrite-title">覆盖旧版本安装包？</h2>
<p id="overwrite-package" class="overwrite-package"></p>
<p id="overwrite-description">确认后将替换旧安装包和更新日志，原下载链接及下载次数保留。</p>
<div class="overwrite-actions"><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-overwrite-cancel autofocus>取消</button><button type="button" class="button" id="overwrite-confirm">确认覆盖</button></div>
</dialog>
</form>
